    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> 3 darts at 1st level, +1 per slot level above 1st. Target one creature and every dart hits it; target several and split the darts between them; target none and pick from every visible creature in range. The dart damage (1d4 + 1 Force) is rolled once and every dart deals that amount.</p>",
